WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.930
Add or subtract numerators only after making denominators equal. Simplify the final

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:06.408
fraction.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:15.168
Calculate 5/8 minus 3/8. The answer is 1/4. Work on the numerators, then simplify:

00:00:15.168 --> 00:00:15.731
1/4.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:22.677
A measuring tape in the class garden starts at 5/8 metre and gains 2/8 metre. What

00:00:22.677 --> 00:00:25.365
length results? Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:33.309
A measuring tape in the class garden starts at 5/8 metre and gains 2/8 metre. What

00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:39.085
length results? The answer is 7/8. Work on the numerators, then simplify: 7/8.
